#: ../../index.md:14
msgid "Contrat Core ↔ Agent"
msgstr "Core ↔ Agent contract"

#: ../../index.md:14
msgid "Spécification"
msgstr "Specification"

#: ../../index.md:23
msgid "Liaison"
msgstr "Liaison"

#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Embewi — Documentation"
msgstr "Embewi — Documentation"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"**Embewi** gère des microcontrôleurs (ESP32) comme des nœuds OTA d'un "
"cluster Kubernetes. Le système est fait de deux composants qui "
"communiquent via un **contrat versionné** — ce dépôt en est la source de "
"vérité."
msgstr ""
"**Embewi** manages microcontrollers (ESP32) as OTA nodes of a Kubernetes "
"cluster. The system is made of two components that communicate via a "
"**versioned contract** — this repository is its source of truth."

#: ../../index.md:12
msgid "Le contrat"
msgstr "The contract"

#: ../../index.md:21
msgid "Liaison Core ↔ Agent"
msgstr "Core ↔ Agent liaison"

#: ../../index.md:30
msgid "Dépôts & docs composant"
msgstr "Repositories & component docs"

#: ../../index.md:32
msgid ""
"**Référence (ce dépôt)** — "
"[`iobewi/embewi`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi) : contrat `v1alpha1` "
"+ doc système + site."
msgstr ""
"**Reference (this repository)** — "
"[`iobewi/embewi`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi): `v1alpha1` contract "
"+ system docs + site."

#: ../../index.md:34
msgid ""
"**Agent** — [`iobewi/embewi-agent-esp`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-"
"agent-esp) · [📖 doc](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi-agent-esp/) : "
"firmware ESP32/ESP-IDF. Docs propres au device (build prod, Secure Boot) "
"sur son site."
msgstr ""
"**Agent** — [`iobewi/embewi-agent-esp`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-"
"agent-esp) · [📖 docs](https://iobewi.github.io/embewi-agent-esp/): "
"ESP32/ESP-IDF firmware. Device-specific docs (production build, Secure "
"Boot) live on its own site."

#: ../../index.md:37
msgid ""
"**Core** — [`iobewi/embewi-core`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-core) "
": runtime Kubernetes. Design des contrôleurs dans son repo."
msgstr ""
"**Core** — [`iobewi/embewi-core`](https://github.com/iobewi/embewi-core)"
": Kubernetes runtime. Controller design lives in its own repo."

#: ../../index.md:40
msgid ""
"Principe : le **contrat** couvre les interfaces stables **inter-"
"composants et externes** (protocole Core↔Agent, mais aussi les interfaces"
" consommées par de l'outillage tiers — ex. noms de métriques Prometheus "
"§8b, gelés au même titre qu'un champ JSON). La doc **propre à "
"l'implémentation** d'un composant (design interne, détails de build) vit "
"avec son code, pour ne pas diverger."
msgstr ""
"Principle: the **contract** covers stable **inter-component and "
"external** interfaces (the Core↔Agent protocol, but also interfaces "
"consumed by third-party tooling — e.g. Prometheus metric names §8b, "
"frozen just like a JSON field). Documentation **specific to a "
"component's implementation** (internal design, build details) lives "
"with its code, so it never drifts out of sync."
